  SmoothNet:
    N. W. Remerscheid, A. Ziller, D. Rueckert, G. Kaissis.
    "SmoothNets: Optimizing CNN architecture design for differentially private
    deep learning." Theory and Practice of Differential Privacy (TPDP)
    Workshop at ICML 2022. arXiv:2205.04095.

